   "en": "Then queenly Juno answered her like this: 'Leave that task to me. Now listen, and in a few words I will show you [how|11,12] what needs to be done can be achieved. Tomorrow, as soon as the sun's first [rays|32,35] have lifted and unveiled the world, Aeneas and poor doomed Dido mean to go out hunting together into the forest.",
